OL,5,G1929 Celebration (Evening Edition)
OL,6,     FThe Reverend Marcus Nelson the
OL,7,     Fminister of St Marks in Gabalfa,
OL,8,     FCardiff looks at how Jesus built
OL,9,     FWales over twenty centuries
OL,10,     Fthrough his church.
OL,11,G2000 Celtic Heartbeat
OL,12,     FFrank Hennessy presents the best
OL,13,     Fin folk, roots and acoustic music
OL,14,     Ffrom the Celtic countries and
OL,15,     Fbeyond.
OL,16,G2200 Beverley's World of Music
OL,17,     FThe finest musical melodies,
OL,18,     Fexquisite performances from stage
OL,19,     Fand screen, and orchestral and
OL,20,     Fchoral works from Wales and the
OL,21,     Fworld. There's no need to book
OL,22,     Fyour seat, just listen and relax.
